---
/**
 * Services section — static Astro port of src/components/Services.tsx.
 * Zero React/framer-motion: entrance fades are CSS keyframes (reduced-motion
 * aware), hover lift is a plain Tailwind transition. The bottom CTA opens the
 * intake flow via `data-open-flow="services"`.
 */
---

<section id="servicios" class="py-24 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    {/* Header */}
    <div class="anim-fade-up text-center mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full mb-4">
        Nuestros Servicios
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
        Defensa Legal <span class="text-primary-600">Especializada</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Más de 15 años protegiendo los derechos de los trabajadores mexicanos.
        Cada caso es único y merece atención personalizada.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Services Grid */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      {/* Despido Injustificado */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-0 group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-rose-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300" />
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-rose-600 mb-5 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" />
              <line x1="17" x2="22" y1="8" y2="13" />
              <line x1="22" x2="17" y1="8" y2="13" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-white mb-3 transition-colors">
            Despido Injustificado
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white/90 text-sm leading-relaxed transition-colors">
            Defendemos tus derechos cuando te despiden sin causa justificada. Calculamos y exigimos tu indemnización completa.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-0 text-white text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </div>

      {/* Acoso Laboral */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-1 group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-amber-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300" />
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-amber-600 mb-5 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z" />
              <path d="M12 9v4" />
              <path d="M12 17h.01" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-white mb-3 transition-colors">
            Acoso Laboral
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white/90 text-sm leading-relaxed transition-colors">
            Te protegemos contra hostigamiento, mobbing y cualquier forma de violencia en tu lugar de trabajo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-0 text-white text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </div>

      {/* Reducción de Salario */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-2 group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-500 to-orange-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300" />
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-500 to-orange-500 mb-5 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="22 17 13.5 8.5 8.5 13.5 2 7" />
              <polyline points="16 17 22 17 22 11" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-white mb-3 transition-colors">
            Reducción de Salario
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white/90 text-sm leading-relaxed transition-colors">
            Combatimos recortes ilegales a tu sueldo, prestaciones o condiciones laborales sin tu consentimiento.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-0 text-white text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </div>

      {/* Incapacidades Médicas */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-3 group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-green-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300" />
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-green-600 mb-5 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z" />
              <path d="M3.22 12H9.5l.5-1 2 4.5 2-7 1.5 3.5h5.27" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-white mb-3 transition-colors">
            Incapacidades Médicas
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white/90 text-sm leading-relaxed transition-colors">
            Aseguramos que recibas todos los beneficios durante enfermedades o accidentes relacionados al trabajo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-0 text-white text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </div>

      {/* Seguridad Social */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-4 group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300" />
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 mb-5 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-white mb-3 transition-colors">
            Seguridad Social
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white/90 text-sm leading-relaxed transition-colors">
            Garantizamos tus derechos ante el IMSS e INFONAVIT. Recuperamos semanas cotizadas no registradas.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-0 text-white text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </div>

      {/* Constitución de Sindicatos */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-5 group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300" />
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 mb-5 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" />
              <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" />
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-white mb-3 transition-colors">
            Constitución de Sindicatos
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white/90 text-sm leading-relaxed transition-colors">
            Asesoramos en la formación legal de sindicatos para defender los derechos colectivos de los trabajadores.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-0 text-white text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </div>

      {/* Riesgos de Trabajo */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-6 group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-violet-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300" />
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-violet-600 mb-5 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M2 18a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h18a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1z" />
              <path d="M10 10V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h2a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v5" />
              <path d="M4 15v-3a6 6 0 0 1 6-6" />
              <path d="M14 6a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v3" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-white mb-3 transition-colors">
            Riesgos de Trabajo
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white/90 text-sm leading-relaxed transition-colors">
            Reclamamos indemnizaciones por accidentes laborales y enfermedades profesionales.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-0 text-white text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </div>

      {/* Pensiones */}
      <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-7 group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-rose-600 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300" />
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-rose-600 mb-5 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1" />
              <path d="M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-white mb-3 transition-colors">
            Pensiones
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 group-hover:text-white/90 text-sm leading-relaxed transition-colors">
            Tramitamos pensiones por invalidez, viudez, orfandad y cesantía. Maximizamos tus beneficios.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-0 text-white text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Bottom CTA */}
    <div class="anim-fade-up anim-delay-4 text-center mt-16">
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
        ¿No encuentras tu situación? Atendemos todos los casos laborales.
      </p>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-open-flow="services"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-gray-900 text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
      >
        Consultar Mi Caso
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Entrance fade-up (replaces framer-motion whileInView) */
  @keyframes fade-up {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
  .anim-fade-up {
    animation: fade-up 0.6s ease-out both;
  }
  .anim-delay-0 { animation-delay: 0s; }
  .anim-delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
  .anim-delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
  .anim-delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
  .anim-delay-4 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
  .anim-delay-5 { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
  .anim-delay-6 { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
  .anim-delay-7 { animation-delay: 0.7s; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .anim-fade-up {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>